## 4. AI images, generated and composite — CC BY-NC 4.0

The images under `src/assets/generated/` were made with generative AI models.
Those labelled "AI-generated" are a model's output as it came. Those labelled
"AI composite" are generated art that Tim selected, retouched and arranged,
often alongside elements drawn or laid out by hand. Whether copyright
subsists in either kind, and how far, differs between jurisdictions. To the
extent it does, it is Copyright (c) 2026 Tim, and the images are licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
License (CC BY-NC 4.0), on the same terms as the written content in section 2:

- give appropriate credit to Tim, with a link back to the piece the image
  appears in;
- indicate if changes were made, and keep the "AI-generated" or
  "AI composite" label; and
- do not use them for commercial purposes.

The post an image appears in names the model that produced it. Some of those
models are released for non-commercial use only, which is a second reason
these images are not offered for commercial use.

No warranty is given. Full legal text:
<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/>
